    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Mlada \u017eena poku\u0161ava shvatiti kako je nestao \u010dovjek iz njene pro\u0161losti, koji nikada nije prona\u0111en. Rat u Hrvatskoj zapanjio je Europu i svijet. Ovo je pri\u010da o potrazi za istinom na mjestu gdje je istina skrivena i od koje se bje\u017ei.",
        "english": "The \"Sixth Bus\" is a film about a young American trying to find a man from her past never to be found, during a biggest conflict on European soil since WWII-battle of Vukovar. It is about a search for identity; simmering beneath this need is a quest for faith,connection and redemption. The \"Sixth Bus\" is a search for truth in a place where truth is selective, elusive and even feared.Ultimately the \"Sixth Bus\" is a film about awakening and freedom."
